---

This application uses the following third-party services and libraries:

- ElevenLabs (https://elevenlabs.io) - Voice cloning and text-to-speech
- OpenAI Whisper (https://openai.com) - Speech recognition
- OpenAI GPT (https://openai.com) - Translation
- Silero VAD (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad) - Voice activity detection
- PyQt6 (https://www.riverbankcomputing.com/software/pyqt/) - GUI framework
- VB-Audio Virtual Cable (https://www.vb-cable.com, https://vb-audio.com/Cable/) - optional third-party donationware audio driver

---

Third-party software: VB-CABLE

This application may optionally include or install VB-CABLE, a virtual
audio driver by VB-Audio Software. VB-CABLE is third-party software,
distributed unmodified as donationware. It is optional and is not
required to use Live Translate for ordinary listening or per-app capture
on supported Windows versions.

If you find VB-CABLE useful, you are welcome to donate or purchase a
license at:

https://www.vb-cable.com
https://vb-audio.com/Cable/

VB-CABLE is copyright VB-Audio Software. See VB-Audio's licensing terms at:

https://vb-audio.com/Services/licensing.htm
